# However when we call `./executable_new import svc file --normalize-keys`, it says "flag needs an argument: --normalize-keys" meaning our Var expects an argument.
# Original's behavior: `--normalize-keys` without value should be allowed (it sets to true). Our Set handles empty string, but pflag still expects an argument? We need to define it as NoOptDefVal.

